      "text": "What a container really is: a process + namespaces (view) + cgroups (budget)",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What a container really is: a process + namespaces (view) + cgroups (budget)",
